                                    "en": {
                                        "title": "[Backup - original] ✨ AI Discover",
                                        "content": "<p><b>AI Discover</b> is a new assistant in Shield Discover that helps you query your data by writing in free, conversational language, as easily as you would with any assistant. It simplifies the search process, giving you quicker access to the data you need, no matter how complex your query may be.</p><p>To get started with AI Discover, follow these steps:</p><ol><li><p>Navigate to <a href=\"https://app.shieldfc.com/search\" target=\"_blank\">Search</a> in the Shield platform.</p></li><li><p>Click on <b><span style=\"color:rgb(24, 201, 142)\">✨ AI Discover</span></b> at the right of the search bar to open the new assistant.</p></li><li><p>Enter your question or request in conversational English.</p></li></ol><p>AI Discover will then offer a short explanation and display the classic search query, while automatically searching and filtering your communications list in the background. You can offer it feedback, or refine your prompt to create even more pinpointed searches.</p><aside class=\"tip\"><p>💡 <b>Tip:</b> AI Discover works best with natural-language prompts. Feel free to write as naturally as you would in a conversation. For example:</p><ul><li><p><i>Show me my most critical non-compliance risks.</i></p></li><li><p><i>I want to see instances of Acme's market abuse in 2020-2022.</i></p></li><li><p><i>Can you find my new high-alert hits?</i></p></li></ul></aside><p></p><aside class=\"warning\"><p>☝️ <b>Tip: </b>AI Discover is available for the <b>Enterprise Plan</b>. <a href=\"https://link-to.pricing\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more.</a></p></aside>"
                                    }
                                }
